  dialogues:
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - The hell was that?
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - The turrets seem to be made up of similar parts as the drones.
    - "The implications are intereseting\u2026"
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "What\u2019s worrying me is how all these machines came all they way out here?"
    - Has someone else been here?
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Maybe the strange man we found in the middle of nowhere knows something?
  - name: Knut
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0819b2a39ff19584597e14c64d8fbdf0, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "\u2026I don\u2019t, sorry"
